section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/4", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [70.1, 561.3, 382.1, 629.1], "layer": "body", "route": "BROKEN_TEXT", "source": "ocr", "label": "text", "text": "Janssen Biotech, Inc. Attention: Yulia Pincus, PhD Associate Director, Global Regulatory Affairs, Immunology Welsh McKean Roads, PO Box 776 Spring House, PA 19477", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/5", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [71.3, 520.1, 161.4, 532.1], "layer": "body", "route": "BROKEN_TEXT", "source": "ocr", "label": "text", "text": "Dear Dr. Pincus:", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/6", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [70.1, 463.9, 504.0, 505.8], "layer": "body", "route": "BROKEN_TEXT", "source": "ocr", "label": "text", "text": "Please refer to your supplemental biologics license application (sBLA), dated and received December 23, 2019 submitted under section 351(a) of the Public Health Service Act for Stelara (ustekinumab) injection.", "status": "reread", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/7", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [70.1, 421.9, 534.3, 450.7], "layer": "body", "route": "BROKEN_TEXT", "source": "ocr", "label": "text", "text": "This \"Changes Being Effected\" supplemental biologics application provides for removal of all reference to the pregnancy registry from the label.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/8", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [70.9, 395.6, 216.4, 408.8], "layer": "body", "route": "BROKEN_TEXT", "source": "ocr", "label": "section_header", "text": "APPROVAL LABELING", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["APPROVAL LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/9", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [69.7, 352.9, 541.5, 380.8], "layer": "body", "route": "BROKEN_TEXT", "source": "ocr", "label": "text", "text": "We have completed our review of this application. It is approved, effective on the date of this letter, for use as recommended in the enclosed agreed-upon labeling.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["APPROVAL LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/10", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [71.3, 327.3, 215.6, 339.3], "layer": "body", "route": "BROKEN_TEXT", "source": "ocr", "label": "section_header", "text": "CONTENT OF LABELING", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/11", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [69.3, 228.7, 533.5, 311.8], "layer": "body", "route": "BROKEN_TEXT", "source": "ocr", "label": "text", "text": "As soon as possible, but no later than 14 days from the date of this letter, submit, via the FDA automated drug registration and listing system (eLIST), the content of labeling [21 CFR 601.14(b)] in structured product labeling (SPL) format, as described at FDat t     t   at e ttion and Medication Guide) and include the labeling changes proposed in any pending “Changes Being Effected” (CBE) supplements.", "status": "needs_review", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/12", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [69.3, 187.6, 504.4, 215.2], "layer": "body", "route": "BROKEN_TEXT", "source": "ocr", "label": "text", "text": "Information on submitting SPL files using eLIST may be found in the guidance for industry SPL Standard for Content of Labeling Technical Qs and As.²", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/13", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [70.5, 160.1, 441.5, 174.4], "layer": "body", "route": "BROKEN_TEXT", "source": "ocr", "label": "text", "text": "The SPL will be accessible via publicly available labeling repositories.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/14", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.1, 117.8, 457.8, 129.3], "layer": "body", "route": "BROKEN_TEXT", "source": "ocr", "label": "footnote", "text": "1 http://www.fda.gov/Forlndustry/DataStandards/StructuredProductLabeling/default.htm", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/15", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [70.1, 83.0, 535.5, 107.0], "layer": "body", "route": "BROKEN_TEXT", "source": "ocr", "label": "footnote", "text": "² We update guidances periodically. For the most recent version of a guidance, check the FDA Guidance Documents Databasehttps://www.fda.gov/Regulatorylnformation/Guidances/default.htm.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/16", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [386.9, 645.1, 540.3, 656.7], "layer": "body", "route": "BROKEN_TEXT", "source": "ocr", "label": "section_header", "text": "SUPPLEMENT APPROVAL", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["SUPPLEMENT APPROVAL"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/17", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [8.8, 7.6, 94.0, 18.0], "layer": "furniture", "route": "BROKEN_TEXT", "source": "ocr", "label": "page_footer", "text": "Reference ID: 4699766", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/18", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [71.3, 742.9, 174.1, 754.9], "layer": "furniture", "route": "BROKEN_TEXT", "source": "ocr", "label": "page_header", "text": "BLA 125261/S-154", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/19", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [71.3, 728.9, 162.2, 740.9], "layer": "furniture", "route": "BROKEN_TEXT", "source": "ocr", "label": "page_header", "text": "BLA 761044/006", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/20", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [70.1, 712.6, 112.4, 728.1], "layer": "furniture", "route": "BROKEN_TEXT", "source": "ocr", "label": "page_header", "text": "Page 2", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/21", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [69.7, 579.6, 539.9, 691.0], "layer": "body", "route": "BROKEN_TEXT", "source": "ocr", "label": "text", "text": "Also within 14 days, amend all pending supplemental applications that include labeling changes for this BLA, including pending “Changes Being Effected” (CBE) supplements, for which FDA has not yet issued an action letter, with the content of labeling [21 CFR 601.12(f)] in Microsoft Word format that includes the changes approved in this supplemental application, as well as annual reportable changes. To facilitate review of your submission(s), provide a highlighted or marked-up copy that shows all changes, as well as a clean Microsoft Word version. The marked-up copy should provide appropriate annotations, including supplement number(s) and annual report date(s).", "status": "reread", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["SUPPLEMENT APPROVAL"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/22", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [70.9, 553.3, 244.2, 566.5], "layer": "body", "route": "BROKEN_TEXT", "source": "ocr", "label": "section_header", "text": "REPORTING REQUIREMENTS", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/23", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [69.7, 511.0, 532.7, 540.1], "layer": "body", "route": "BROKEN_TEXT", "source": "ocr", "label": "text", "text": "We remind you that you must comply with reporting requirements for an approved BLA (in 21 CFR 600.80 and in 21 CFR 600.81).", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/24", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [70.9, 469.9, 488.9, 497.0], "layer": "body", "route": "BROKEN_TEXT", "source": "ocr", "label": "text", "text": "If you have any questions, call Dawn Williams, Regulatory Project Manager, at (301)796-5376.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/25", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [277.3, 441.5, 333.1, 456.3], "layer": "body", "route": "BROKEN_TEXT", "source": "ocr", "label": "text", "text": "Sincerely,", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/26", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [278.1, 414.0, 503.6, 428.7], "layer": "body"